  "question": {
    "text": "A particle is projected from the ground and simultaneously a wedge starts moving towards the right, as shown in the figure. The maximum height of the wedge for which the particle will not hit the wedge is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" height=\"143\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image5-c02a646a-0b9f-416d-9ce3-ddec6920fa2f.jpg\" width=\"283\" />",
